{"id": "De_GUj1SBvC", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Gully ke ek lamp se stage ki spotlight tak… roshni wahi thi, bas usne chalna nahi chhoda 🌟\n\nShawarma ke thele wali gully, chhat pe raat bhar chalti kalam, haathon ke chhaale… phir Bandra ki khidki se Sea Link ki roshni.\nBaap ko gaadi ki chaabi, behen ki photo phone pe, aur dost? Ek ek karke andhere mein chale gaye. Spotlight sirf us par rahi.\n“Kalakaari kabhi biki thi na” — deal sign hui, par notebook aaj bhi hoodie ki jeb mein hai 📓\nAur aakhir mein, sone ke us sitaare pe ek hi naam khud gaya: whysoKai ⭐\n\n🎵 Subtle Starboy · whysoKai · Hustle 5 (Apna Homeground) @whysokai @kai.kartos \n\nYeh reel us dost ko bhejo jo gully se nikla tha sirf apne gaane ke bharose 🚀\n\nSubtle Starboy | whysoKai | Hustle 5 | Apna Homeground | desi hip hop | Hindi rap | rapper journey | gully to stardom | painted animation | neon city art | Bandra Sea Link | music video art\n\n#SubtleStarboy #whysoKai #Hustle5 #DesiHipHop #PaintedAnimation", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1793078718, "like_count": 14269, "comment_count": 42, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1785670002863108a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 70.757, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPWQQ3Kc3_-HF4TaYM_oCFf9SMAXhMJRQ9oDfG2liN29UBktjEUuqxDF1sx1kziUd1r0knApg42hgBT42HT2mNsshvC8SivbNpuDQY.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=AdrhQ7GHhRPe3bxO_Y44jVtoeHqTP-XoKjLQvT9oMDBB0K6Q9Kr87WzcVAGzKEpmZlmOkYCX0s_pCn2bCe_j-xzD&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht